        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 kunit: add create/attr_set/ref/destroy mocks and tests",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 kunit: add create/attr_set/ref/destroy mocks and tests\n\nExtend mock_ost with do_{declare_,}create(), do_{declare_,}attr_set(),\ndo_{declare_,}ref_add(), do_{declare_,}ref_del() and do_object_sync()\nsupport (call counters, last-argument capture and forced error\nreturns), matching the do_xattr_get()/do_declare_xattr_set() mocks\nalready there.\n\nAdd lod_object_test covering the cluster of lod_object.c\ndt_object_operations wrappers that these newly-mocked child ops\nunlock for an unstriped regular file: lod_{declare_,}create(),\nlod_{declare_,}attr_set(), lod_{declare_,}ref_add(),\nlod_{declare_,}ref_del(), lod_{declare_,}destroy() and\nlod_object_sync(). Make these functions non-static and export them\nso the new kunit module can call them directly.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-4.5 [augment-cli]\nChange-Id: Id86e46955eb620d2be235272e9cb5d2709b07817\n"
      },
